// Central GDScript bytecode specification.
//
// Keep this file free of include guards: it is intentionally included more
// than once to generate the opcode enum and its descriptor table.
//
// GDSCRIPT_OPCODE(name, instruction_size, operands, result_operand,
//                 control_flow, type_constraint, relocation_kind)
//
// An instruction_size of 0 denotes a variadic instruction. Its operands must
// start with ARGUMENT_COUNT, VARIADIC_FRAME_SLOTS. The encoded argument count
// gives the number of frame-slot words represented by that variadic marker;
// the remaining declared operands are the fixed suffix.

